## Declared High-Blast-Radius Surfaces

*Declared by the operator before the first autonomous capability is enabled. These are the surfaces of {{project_name}} where a bad automated change does the most damage — the ones ADR-#1-style commitments place permanently off-limits to parallel or unattended execution. Name them concretely (a directory, a subsystem, a class of change), so eligibility is checkable, not arguable.*

